          "ruleId": "LOL-CAP",
          "level": "preferred",
          "summary": "Add a mutual monetary cap with Excluded Claims carve-outs",
          "comment": "[Playbook] Section 15 excludes indirect damages but sets no aggregate cap, leaving both parties exposed without limit. Our position is a mutual cap at the greater of 12 months' fees and USD 1,000,000, with confidentiality, IP indemnity, gross negligence/wilful misconduct/fraud and Sparkling's payment obligations sitting outside the cap.",
          "ops": [
            {
              "kind": "replace",
              "paragraphId": "p0105",
              "oldText": "The limitation of liability in this Section 15 shall not apply to breaches of Sections 13 and 14.",
              "newText": "Except for Excluded Claims, each party's total aggregate liability arising out of or relating to this Agreement shall not exceed the greater of (a) the fees paid or payable by Sparkling under this Agreement in the twelve (12) months immediately preceding the event giving rise to the claim and (b) USD 1,000,000. \"Excluded Claims\" means a party's breach of Section 13 or Section 14, its indemnification obligations, its gross negligence, wilful misconduct or fraud, and its infringement of the other party's intellectual property rights; Sparkling's obligation to pay fees shall not be treated as damages for purposes of this Section. The limitation of liability in this Section 15 shall not apply to Excluded Claims."
            }
          ]
        },
        "caller": {
          "type": "direct"
        }
      },
